    "_id": "before0000000000",
    "type": "base",
    "description": "<p>Each target is [[/apply DSCTmarkBtlPln01]]{marked} by you. Immediately and until the end of the encounter, the Director tells you if any creatures marked by you have damage immunity or weakness and the value of that immunity or weakness. Additionally, you and each ally within 3 squares of you [[/surge 2]].</p><p><strong>Mark Benefit</strong>: Until the end of the encounter, whenever you or any ally makes a strike against a creature marked by you, you can spend 2 focus to make the strike ignore damage immunity and deal extra [[/damage 3*@R]]{damage} equal to three times your Reason score.</p>",
